52
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:04,980
Quiet spirit.

53
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:07,980
That's exactly what I'm trying to work on right now.

54
00:03:11,980 --> 00:03:15,980
I'm paying too much attention to everything that's going on around me.

55
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:19,980
I need to get rid of irrelevant thoughts.

56
00:03:21,980 --> 00:03:23,980
What drives me is curiosity.

57
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:28,980
I always do my best work when the subject at hand intrigues me.

58
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:32,980
That's what I need to focus on.

59
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:45,980
The tension is starting to leave his body.

60
00:03:54,980 --> 00:03:56,980
He may be the DWMA's greatest Meister.

61
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:59,980
He's an easy guy to read if you know what to look for.

62
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:02,980
